# Flight Sim is its own public repository (github.com/NuclearPlane787/flight-sim).
# Shane's raw downloads (hundreds of MB): the bake scripts in tools/ read them, the game never does.
reference/raw/
.DS_Store
# The Airbus and EASA PDFs (11 MB, third-party documents): re-download with PLAN.md → Data.
# The numbers taken from them, with page references, are in src/sim/a321neo.js.
reference/docs/*.pdf
# Python's bytecode cache (tools/*.py)
__pycache__/
